    "---\n",
    "### Data Preprocessing: Itis & Myyrmanni Accessibility Matrices\n",
    "Origin-destination travel times are processed across target shopping centres. Unreachable grid cells or missing network connections represented by `-1` are reassigned as null values (`NaN`) to ensure unbiased spatial analysis.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Ingest, clean, and join travel time matrices with spatial grid cells\n"
